CORE libstdcxx16
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ may throw: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ does not throw: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ invocable: SUCCESS$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The builtin's probe of the call is now also checked for being
potentially-throwing.
